      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MY MATE ROBBIE (2) turned in a strong run last time, placing in a Grade 5 when third behind Ivory Pygmy in a handy 23.17 and setting a new course and distance PB. Going well and can measure up this time. JETSON (4) goes very well over this track and trip including four wins. Was out of the placings last time (23.21) at this track in a Grade 2/3/4, finishing fourth and beaten 5 lengths. Looks a key chance on best figures. MAJOR QUEEN (6) missed the frame last time when sixth (31.54) in a Grade 5 at Angle Park after a slow start and settling well off the pace. Form at the trip sound including four wins. Speedy beginner who can find the front despite the tricky draw. Worth another chance. TRADING HALT (1) boasts a solid strike-rate from this box.",
